{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id577020231"}, "name":{"label":"Gaia4eva"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-09-09T05:08:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0.97"}, "id":{"label":"14528914094"}, "title":{"label":"System Failure"}, "content":{"label":"The AI consistently fails to follow clear and specific instructions. I explicitly tell it not to change, remove, duplicate, or add lyrics, yet it continues to alter the structure, repeat lyrics, and unnecessarily extend songs to five minutes or longer.\n\nI also give clear instructions for a short musical opening and a natural ending, but the system often creates long instrumental sections or ends the song incorrectly, sometimes before the vocals are even completed.\n\nI have had to regenerate the same song multiple times just to try to get the AI to follow basic directions, wasting both time and generations. Even after simplifying the instructions, the same problems continue.\n\nFor a paid AI music service, users should be able to expect the system to respect their lyrics, requested structure, and basic production instructions. The music can sound beautiful, but that becomes irrelevant when the AI repeatedly ignores the user’s directions and cannot reliably complete the song as requested.\n\nThe AI instruction-following and song-length control need significant improvement.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6482289804&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
